{"text": "A little green lizard, a butterfly, and a daisy asked why he was weeping. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He is weeping for a red rose, said the Nightingale. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For a red rose, How very silly, they cried, and the lizard laughed out loud. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the Nightingale understood his sorrow, and she sat silently in the oak tree. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Suddenly she spread her brown wings and flew to a rose tree in the middle of the grass. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Give me a red rose, and I will sing you my sweetest song, she cried. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the tree shook its head and said, My roses are white. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The yellow rose tree that grew by the old sundial also shook its head. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At last she found the rose tree which grew beneath the Students window. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> My roses are red, it said, but the winter has chilled my veins, and the storm has broken my branches. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There is a way, but it is so terrible that I am afraid to tell you.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", " ", "l", "i", "t", "t", "l", "e", " ", "g", "r", "e", "e", "n", " ", "l", "i", "z", "a", "r", "d", ",", " ", "a", " ", "b", "u", "t", "t", "e", "r", "f", "l", "y", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "a", " ", "d", "a", "i", "s", "y", " ", "a", "s", "k", "e", "d", " ", "w", "h", "y", " ", "h", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "w", "e", "e", "p", "i", "n", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "i", "s", " ", "w", "e", "e", "p", "i", "n", "g", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "a", " ", "r", "e", "d", " ", "r", "o", "s", "e", ",", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "N", "i", "g", "h", "t", "i", "n", "g", "a", "l", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "F", "o", "r", " ", "a", " ", "r", "e", "d", " ", "r"